# Simple card icons

If a card is **only a heading + description** (no link, no button, no image), add a Tabler icon. Do not leave it as plain text in a box.

Use `InfoCard` with `icon="tabler:name"`. Pick an icon that exists in Tabler (check `@iconify-json/tabler`) and matches the card topic.

Icon mark (do not invent a new treatment):

- Light / yellow-tint cards: `w-10 h-10 rounded-md bg-[#222]` with `<Icon class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" />`
- Dark / `#222` cards: `w-10 h-10 rounded-md border border-accent/60` with the same gold icon
- Place the mark **above** the heading. One icon per card. No colored blobs, no emoji, no Lucide/Heroicons.

Do **not** add icons to P-05 service cards (those already have a bottom link) unless the brief asks for them.
